WEBVTT

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:31.155
there will be more and more
specialized drawing houses,

00:07:31.155 --> 00:07:33.908
which could help with designs and drawing

00:07:33.908 --> 00:07:37.870
so that more writers
could provide great stories

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.705
without having to be great artists.

00:07:40.664 --> 00:07:42.791
For streaming networks,

00:07:42.791 --> 00:07:47.046
they will continue to keep an eye
on unique stories starting from webtoons

00:07:47.046 --> 00:07:48.047
to web novel,

00:07:48.047 --> 00:07:49.423
to classic novel --

00:07:49.423 --> 00:07:50.549
even mythology.

00:07:51.133 --> 00:07:52.176
Who knows?

00:07:52.343 --> 00:07:57.932
Maybe the next big-hit drama could
even originate from an old goddess story

00:07:57.932 --> 00:07:59.683
in an island in Indonesia.